Package: asgard-accessibility
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 at-spi2-core,
 orca
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ desktop accessibility
 Adds the GNOME accessibility stack on top of the base desktop:
 .
   * at-spi2-core    assistive technology service bus (used by orca
                     and by GTK's assistive interfaces — most GTK
                     apps will use it when available)
   * orca            screen reader for blind / low-vision users
 .
 Pairs with INST-02 (TODO) which extends accessibility into the
 installer ramdisk (speakup udeb + brltty udeb for screen reader
 and braille support during install).  This metapackage covers the
 installed-system side of accessibility — the installer side is
 separately tracked.
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
